<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(Advanced Software Testing Overview: Cinute Digital\220s 95 hours Advanced Software Testing program is designed by Industry experts and Senior personnel who have been working in the Industry for decades now. As Cinute Digital is an Ed-Tech subsidiary of Testriq QA Lab which is an IT service provider company, we have a very deep understanding and ground reality exposure to everything that goes into testing and delivering a Website, App or Software. This course will give you access to all the tools and technologies that you will find yourself using once you start working. )/E(Advanced Software Testing Overview: Cinute Digital\220s 95 hours Advanced Software Testing program is designed by Industry experts and Senior personnel who have been working in the Industry for decades now. As Cinute Digital is an Ed-Tech subsidiary of Testriq QA Lab which is an IT service provider company, we have a very deep understanding and ground reality exposure to everything that goes into testing and delivering a Website, App or Software. This course will give you access to all the tools and technologies that you will find yourself using once you start working. )/Pg 10 0 R/K[47]>>
