<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(Why Software Testing  If you are stuck in your field with no scope or growth in future or your domain has reached a saturation point and you want to build yourself a stable longterm career in IT, Manual Testing should be your go to option. As manual testing does not require coding knowledge you\220ll feel extremely comfortable to lean into it and this is the reason anyone from IT or non IT can learn and start working on Testing Projects.)/E(Why Software Testing  If you are stuck in your field with no scope or growth in future or your domain has reached a saturation point and you want to build yourself a stable longterm career in IT, Manual Testing should be your go to option. As manual testing does not require coding knowledge you\220ll feel extremely comfortable to lean into it and this is the reason anyone from IT or non IT can learn and start working on Testing Projects.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[48]>>
