<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(This course provides integrated assignments to implement best practices in Data Analytics and offers intensive interview preparation from Day 1, equipping you for interviews with over 2,000 hiring partners. You'll engage in capstone projects, gaining practical experience that mirrors real-world situations. The all-encompassing curriculum spans foundational concepts to advanced techniques, catering to both novices and those seeking to refine their skills. Expert instructors will support you throughout the process, enabling you to unlock your potential as a confident, industry-ready Data Analyst. Collaborating with AAA, this Data Analytics course is designed to empower both beginners and professionals with the essential skills needed for today's career landscape.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[44]>>
